âtre de la Poste - Foix","date":null,"time":"","place":"13 Bis rue des Moulins, Foix","lat":42.966125,"lng":1.60384,"price":"Voir sur place","thumb":"","source":"datatourisme","createdAt":1792032330060,"description":"Le Café-Théâtre de la Poste à Foix, un lieu unique en son genre où vous pourrez découvrir des artistes confirmés dans un cadre intimiste, convivial\r\net chaleureux.","photo":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/Agen_-_Th%C3%A9%C3%A2tre_Ducourneau_-_2.jpg/960px-Agen_-_Th%C3%A9%C3%A2tre_Ducourneau_-_2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","photoCredit":"Illustration · Benjamin Smith, CC BY-SA 4.0","photoGeneric":true},{"id":"dt-place-9184ab95-7f6d-3de7-b153-801f6302985b","isPlace":true,"scene":"village","city":"foix","category":"À voir","title":"L'atelier des remparts","date":null,"time":"","place":"9 rue Villeneuve, Foix","lat":42.965761,"lng":1.608028,"price":"Voir sur place","thumb":"","source":"datatourisme","createdAt":1792032330060,"description":"Depuis près de 20 ans, Sandrine perpétue les gestes de ce savoir-faire ancestral dans le plus grand respect du siège pour lui redonner vie et mettre en valeur les étoffes les plus diverses.","photo":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/25/The_Radical_Textiles_Exhibition_at_the_Art_Gallery_of_South_Australia_during_the_opening_in_November_2024_08.jpg/960px-The_Radical_Textiles_Exhibition_at_the_Art_Gallery_of_South_Australia_during_the_opening_in_November_2024_08.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","photoCredit":"Illustration · Aliceinthealice, CC0","photoGeneric":true},{"id":"dt-place-ab18d60a-c781-3abf-a4aa-cb3807f92048","isPlace":true,"scene":"village","city":"foix","category":"À voir","title":"Boutique - Les Biscuits du Moulin","date":null,"time":"","place":"Avenue Paul Berdot Le Moulin - Route nationale 20, Aulos-Sinsat","lat":42.799153,"lng":1.660235,"price":"Voir sur plac